WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:02.800
The Resetting Ghana Agenda is working.

00:02.800 --> 00:04.900
The Accra reset is gaining momentum,

00:04.900 --> 00:07.400
and together, they are laying the foundation

00:07.400 --> 00:10.200
for a stronger, more resilient, and more prosperous Ghana.

00:10.200 --> 00:12.700
Mr. Speaker, our nation is on the runway.

00:12.700 --> 00:15.000
It is in take-off mode,

00:15.000 --> 00:18.500
and you are all advised to fasten your seat belts.

00:18.500 --> 00:39.600
[music]

00:39.600 --> 00:43.100
Rich in human ingenuity and natural resources,

00:43.100 --> 00:48.300
stable Ghana stands tall as host of AfCFTA,

00:48.300 --> 00:52.400
the true gateway to the African continent.

00:52.400 --> 00:55.700
We have restored stability and renewed confidence

00:55.700 --> 00:58.200
in the Ghanaian economy.

00:58.200 --> 01:00.400
Our vision is clear:

01:00.400 --> 01:04.500
we're building a productive, export-oriented, industrialized, and technology-driven economy

01:04.500 --> 01:09.300
that creates opportunities for our people and competitive returns for investors.

01:09.300 --> 01:12.400
At the center of this transformation is our flagship

01:12.400 --> 01:15.200
24-Hour Economy Initiative

01:15.200 --> 01:18.800
and accelerated export development program.

01:21.000 --> 01:25.000
During his previous administration, he had actually brought in

01:25.000 --> 01:28.100
over 3 billion in foreign direct investment.

01:28.100 --> 01:31.000
And I asked him a question that, how did he do that?

01:31.000 --> 01:34.000
And the way he answered it, he says, "Joe,

01:34.000 --> 01:37.300
when I come back, I want to do that plus more."

01:37.300 --> 01:40.800
And lo and behold, he really kept his word. We're going to invest $2 billion

01:40.800 --> 01:45.000
and drill about, you know, up to about 20 wells.

01:45.000 --> 01:48.100
Just last year, we had that discussion with the president, and the president says,

01:48.100 --> 01:52.300
"I'm all on board. I want to do that. I will do my part.

01:52.300 --> 01:55.000
What is What are you going to do?"

01:55.000 --> 01:58.000
And then we say, we're going to get our partners to actually line up to it.

01:58.000 --> 02:00.600
And lo and behold, within a short period of time,

02:00.600 --> 02:04.500
everything's signed and sealed, and now we doing the investment. So it's quite an exciting period right now.

02:04.500 --> 02:08.500
Ghana has always been a miracle story, and President Mahama has demonstrated that ability,

02:08.500 --> 02:12.500
taking over an economy that was in a junk status and has turned around that story

02:12.500 --> 02:16.800
into what every investor looks for. And that's the kind of leadership that he has offered

02:16.800 --> 02:20.400
over this year and half that has transformed our country, and changed our VAT laws,

02:20.400 --> 02:24.400
increased our reserves, made us owners of our gold processing.

02:24.400 --> 02:28.500
And this is what creates the story of a new Ghana and a new economy.

02:28.500 --> 02:34.000
President Mahama aligns disciplined economic management and prudent monetary policy

02:34.000 --> 02:38.000
with his flagship Big Push, expanding infrastructure

02:38.000 --> 02:42.000
and unlocking production bottlenecks. This is attracting investors,

02:42.000 --> 02:45.500
indigenous and foreign.

02:45.500 --> 02:49.000
We seek investors who are prepared to build long-term partnerships with us,

02:49.000 --> 02:53.000
partnerships that are grounded in mutual respect, transparency,

02:53.000 --> 02:56.500
and shared prosperity.

02:56.500 --> 03:00.000
My government stands ready to work with you.

03:00.000 --> 03:05.400
In the space of just 6 months, we've completed or announced three new landmark IPOs,

03:05.400 --> 03:11.000
the most active primary issuance period in nearly a decade.

03:11.000 --> 03:16.000
Three IPOs, three oversubscriptions, three sectors: banking, energy,

03:16.000 --> 03:21.000
and fast-moving consumer goods. This is not a coincidence.

03:21.000 --> 03:23.500
This is confidence.

03:23.500 --> 03:26.500
We are inviting others to come along on this journey,

03:26.500 --> 03:30.000
where we've created a path of opportunities to partner with our people,

03:30.000 --> 03:34.500
to grow our economy, to create value for them, and also value for for for our people.

03:34.500 --> 03:39.000
This is the time for us to move from conversations to commitments.

03:39.000 --> 03:43.000
This is the time to invest in Ghana.

03:43.000 --> 03:47.000
Driving economic strength, building world-class infrastructure,

03:47.000 --> 03:51.000
and opening new industrial frontiers, the Resetting Ghana Agenda

03:51.000 --> 03:55.000
unlocks the full power of AfCFTA.

03:55.000 --> 03:58.500
Welcome to Ghana, your gateway to Africa.

03:58.500 --> 04:08.533
[music]
